/T (This report examines how a global e-commerce application can deliver product discovery, customer accounts, shopping carts, checkout and order management at scale. It uses public Amazon and AWS engineering material to explain the architectural patterns associated with Amazon.com. Some implementation details are proprietary and are not publicly documented as one complete technology stack; therefore, the diagram is a conceptual model, not an exact internal deployment map.)
/E (This report examines how a global e-commerce application can deliver product discovery, customer accounts, shopping carts, checkout and order management at scale. It uses public Amazon and AWS engineering material to explain the architectural patterns associated with Amazon.com. Some implementation details are proprietary and are not publicly documented as one complete technology stack; therefore, the diagram is a conceptual model, not an exact internal deployment map.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [16]
>>
