/T (A retail platform must protect accounts, addresses and payment-related workflows. Common controls include encrypted transport \(HTTPS/TLS\), access control, monitoring, abuse protection, secure secrets handling, backups and recovery planning. Multi-zone deployment and redundant components can improve availability, while rate limits and workload isolation can help protect dependencies during traffic surges.)
/E (A retail platform must protect accounts, addresses and payment-related workflows. Common controls include encrypted transport \(HTTPS/TLS\), access control, monitoring, abuse protection, secure secrets handling, backups and recovery planning. Multi-zone deployment and redundant components can improve availability, while rate limits and workload isolation can help protect dependencies during traffic surges.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
