/Title (Amazon does not publish one definitive web-server product that can accurately be described as the sole server for all of Amazon.com. A large site can use edge delivery, load balancers, web servers, API front doors and internal service-to-service networking together. Therefore, it would be misleading to state that the entire site uses only Nginx or Apache. For this case study, the web-server role is described as a distributed web/API entry layer, with the exact production server implementation not publicly confirmed in the cited sources.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 324 0 R
>>
